  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using imagenet_vit_l as the image encoder (config_039) significantly improves performance compared to resnet50. This experiment tests whether the RNA encoder choice (scgpt vs. scvi_n200) impacts performance when using the high-performing image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. It isolates the RNA encoder's effect, a critical design decision, while building on the strong baseline of config_039. This balances exploitation of promising directions with exploration of encoder variability."
}

